==Strategy==
This stage is almost exactly the same as [[Festival Gross (Insane)|Festival Gross]], except Manic Macho Legs Cat has over double the HP of Crazed Gross and has higher level Wave Attacks, allowing it to snipe more units that are further back. Other than that, the general strategy remains the same: stack ranged attackers to knock back the MMLs before they get a chance to attack.

Just like the previous stage, this stage becomes far easier if the player has access to [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|wave blockers]] like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]].

